        "original_id": "6f61875a-3665-5609-9da1-41b4ffc2e1a6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Non-Stop, Project X, Equilibrium, Scream, Scary Movie\n- People: Jaume Collet-Serra, Liam Neeson, Julianne Moore, Michelle Dockery, Lupita Nyong'o, Scoot McNairy, Andrew Rona\n- TV Series: Downton Abbey\n- Roles: Lady Mary Crawley\n- Awards: Emmy Awards, Golden Globe Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Downton Abbey ran from 2010 to 2015, and Michelle Dockery was widely known for playing Lady Mary Crawley in the ITV and PBS period drama series.\n- Michelle Dockery received three consecutive Emmy Award nominations for Outstanding Lead Actress in a Drama Series and a Golden Globe Award nomination for her performance in Downton Abbey.\n- Non-Stop is a 2014 American mystery action thriller film directed by Jaume Collet-Serra.\n- Non-Stop stars Liam Neeson, Julianne Moore, Michelle Dockery, Lupita Nyong'o, and Scoot McNairy.\n- Andrew Rona has produced over 100 films, including Non-Stop, Project X, Equilibrium, Scream, and Scary Movie.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
